WEBVTT

00:00:06.740 --> 00:00:10.620
Welcome to our Velvet Room.

00:00:10.620 --> 00:00:15.590
Thanks to your efforts, the incidents with
the lurking Shadows have been resolved.

00:00:15.590 --> 00:00:18.420
And the fog over the real
world seems to have lifted.

00:00:18.420 --> 00:00:21.760
I commend you for coming this far,
never succumbing to all those hardships.

00:00:21.760 --> 00:00:23.510
Thank you for your hard work.

00:00:24.260 --> 00:00:29.350
I am sure that you have earned the right
to accept the peace before your eyes...

00:00:29.930 --> 00:00:37.520
For now, perhaps it wouldn't be such a bad thing
to rest both soul and body, and wallow in bliss.

00:02:15.080 --> 00:02:17.460
The 24th... do you have any plans?

00:02:17.460 --> 00:02:19.080
The 24th?

00:02:19.330 --> 00:02:20.750
I think I'm free!

00:02:20.750 --> 00:02:22.750
Good. Then keep it open, okay?

00:02:22.750 --> 00:02:23.800
Okay!

00:02:23.800 --> 00:02:25.130
Counting on you!

00:02:25.130 --> 00:02:26.340
Hey, wanna go?

00:02:26.340 --> 00:02:27.470
Yes, let's go!

00:02:27.470 --> 00:02:30.180
I hear the quality of this
cake is pretty amazing!

00:02:30.180 --> 00:02:32.180
Can't wait!

00:02:33.930 --> 00:02:35.430
Christmas?

00:02:36.770 --> 00:02:38.560
Th-The 24th?

00:02:39.230 --> 00:02:40.360
It should be fine...

00:02:40.360 --> 00:02:42.270
Then keep it open, okay?

00:02:43.270 --> 00:02:45.070
What should I do?

00:02:45.190 --> 00:02:46.530
Yes, I'm free!

00:02:46.530 --> 00:02:47.820
Of course I'm free!

00:02:47.820 --> 00:02:50.820
I-Is that right? Then
I'm counting on you.

00:02:51.410 --> 00:02:53.370
Oh, Senpai!

00:02:53.370 --> 00:02:55.250
You can be unexpectedly bold!

00:02:55.250 --> 00:02:57.410
Well, I am free, but...

00:02:57.410 --> 00:03:00.080
Good. Then I'll be
counting on you on the 24th.

00:03:00.080 --> 00:03:02.000
Senpai! Um...

00:03:02.000 --> 00:03:03.290
What's the matter?

00:03:03.750 --> 00:03:05.210
Nothing.

00:03:05.210 --> 00:03:06.720
I see.

00:03:07.840 --> 00:03:10.220
December 24th.

00:03:10.430 --> 00:03:12.350
Christmas Eve.

00:03:12.350 --> 00:03:15.930
The Holy Night that lovers are
said to spend together...

00:03:15.930 --> 00:03:17.680
Hey! How'd it go?

00:03:17.680 --> 00:03:19.020
Everyone can make it.

00:03:19.270 --> 00:03:23.820
Hey, that's a relief. I was worried,
since it's totally short notice.

00:03:23.820 --> 00:03:29.650
Okay, since we're all here, all that's left is
to get ready for the big day, right?

00:03:29.650 --> 00:03:31.360
Yeah. Let's enjoy it...

00:03:31.360 --> 00:03:33.160
A Christmas party for all of us!

00:03:43.040 --> 00:03:45.170
This! And this!

00:03:45.670 --> 00:03:47.050
And we'll need this, too!

00:03:47.670 --> 00:03:51.380
I hear that Adachi-san is
confessing to everything.

00:03:51.380 --> 00:03:53.720
About Ms. Yamano and
Konishi-senpai, too.

00:03:53.720 --> 00:03:55.810
That he hung them from
the antennas himself.

00:03:55.810 --> 00:03:56.770
Is that right?

00:03:57.520 --> 00:04:00.640
Since he can't describe
that world inside the TV,

00:04:00.940 --> 00:04:04.360
I hear there's been
all sorts of problems...

00:04:04.650 --> 00:04:08.280
But that should resolve itself
eventually, too, Dojima-san says.

00:04:09.360 --> 00:04:11.030
So it's over, right?

00:04:11.400 --> 00:04:14.450
Yeah, it's over. At last.

00:04:14.450 --> 00:04:15.990
Also, this!

00:04:16.450 --> 00:04:19.080
Hey, how much are you gonna
stuff into that cart, anyway?

00:04:19.080 --> 00:04:20.710
We don't need all this, okay?

00:04:20.710 --> 00:04:23.380
Anyway, why is it only us guys?

00:04:23.380 --> 00:04:26.670
It's Christmas shopping -
let's make the girls help out, too.

00:04:26.670 --> 00:04:27.840
Dumbass! Listen...

00:04:27.840 --> 00:04:32.550
If that happens, then Yu's house will be crammed
with useless ingredients for manufacturing Object X!

00:04:32.550 --> 00:04:34.090
That would be a scene from hell...

00:04:34.090 --> 00:04:37.930
Listen up! We're not letting them
do any of the party cooking!

00:04:37.930 --> 00:04:40.060
Yu will be the leader,
and we're his assistants.

00:04:40.060 --> 00:04:41.430
This lineup is written in stone!

00:04:41.430 --> 00:04:43.310
Written in stone!

00:04:43.560 --> 00:04:45.770
So the girls are only gonna eat?

00:04:45.770 --> 00:04:47.940
Makes you kinda envious, huh?

00:04:48.650 --> 00:04:53.700
Right about now, they're lazing around
at home, going, "Can't wait till tomorrow!"

00:04:56.450 --> 00:04:58.950
<i>So it was you after all, Thunder Cross!</i>

00:05:00.870 --> 00:05:04.830
<i>I'm going to dye this snowy
tundra red with your blood.</i>

00:05:07.500 --> 00:05:09.000
No good.

00:05:09.000 --> 00:05:12.050
Even though this is the only
Christmas movie I've got...

00:05:12.050 --> 00:05:14.470
It's not a good reference at all.

00:05:15.050 --> 00:05:15.890
<i>I wonder what...?</i>

00:05:15.890 --> 00:05:18.220
<i>Lettuce? Bursting with fiber!</i>

00:05:18.220 --> 00:05:23.230
The Holy Night That You Want to 
Spend With Your Lover

00:05:18.720 --> 00:05:20.430
<i>Tonight's special feature is...</i>

00:05:20.430 --> 00:05:23.230
<i>The Holy Night That You Want to
Spend With Your Lover!</i>

00:05:23.890 --> 00:05:28.820
So he was asking me out
on a date, right?

00:05:28.820 --> 00:05:29.980
But why?

00:05:29.980 --> 00:05:33.110
After all, Narukami-kun
and I are friends.

00:05:33.740 --> 00:05:35.490
Should I turn him down?

00:05:35.490 --> 00:05:38.580
No, but I've already said yes...

00:05:38.580 --> 00:05:41.490
Oh, man! I have no idea
what I should do!

00:05:41.490 --> 00:05:45.540
<i>There's still time to get this week's
special feature! Popular Christmas fashion!</i>

00:05:45.540 --> 00:05:47.750
<i>On sale at book stores
all over the country!</i>

00:05:48.170 --> 00:05:50.250
Fashion?

00:05:52.300 --> 00:05:54.880
What am I doing, anyway?

00:05:57.590 --> 00:05:58.550
Yukiko?

00:05:58.850 --> 00:05:59.800
Chie!

00:05:59.800 --> 00:06:44.810
Women's Fashion                              Women

00:06:01.640 --> 00:06:02.890
What a coincidence, huh?

00:06:02.890 --> 00:06:05.850
Yes, it's an amazing coincidence!
Are you going to buy this?

00:06:05.850 --> 00:06:06.850
Uh, yeah.

00:06:06.850 --> 00:06:08.270
No, actually, I'm not!

00:06:08.270 --> 00:06:11.070
Wait, what do I mean
I'm not? Um... Oh, right!

00:06:11.070 --> 00:06:15.450
The feature on meat! I heard that this week
they were doing a meat feature, so...

00:06:15.450 --> 00:06:17.450
Well, not that I know
that they really are...

00:06:17.450 --> 00:06:19.200
But it can't hurt to buy it, right?

00:06:19.200 --> 00:06:21.580
Oh, really?

00:06:21.580 --> 00:06:23.120
That's unexpected...

00:06:23.120 --> 00:06:25.160
Are you going to
buy this too, Yukiko?

00:06:25.160 --> 00:06:27.830
Uh... yes! You see...

00:06:27.830 --> 00:06:31.880
there's a kimono-wearing
feature, I heard.

00:06:32.960 --> 00:06:34.760
Meat and kimonos, huh?

00:06:34.760 --> 00:06:37.180
Pretty diverse, huh, this magazine.

00:06:37.180 --> 00:06:39.340
Yes, it is! Yes.

00:06:39.680 --> 00:06:41.100
Yeah...

00:06:47.940 --> 00:06:50.360
<i>What am I doing?</i>

00:06:50.360 --> 00:06:52.860
<i>Telling me to leave Christmas open...</i>

00:06:52.860 --> 00:06:56.320
<i>he was asking me on a date, wasn't he?</i>

00:06:56.740 --> 00:06:59.070
<i>A date so suddenly...
I don't know what to do!</i>

00:06:59.070 --> 00:07:02.080
<i>In the first place,
Narukami-kun's a friend,</i>

00:07:02.080 --> 00:07:05.160
<i>so I can't even imagine what
it would be like to date him!</i>

00:07:05.160 --> 00:07:06.500
<i>But...</i>

00:07:05.700 --> 00:07:07.830
Let's stay together forever!

00:07:08.040 --> 00:07:09.080
Okay.

00:07:08.210 --> 00:07:10.290
<i>But if that were to happen...</i>

00:07:10.290 --> 00:07:14.170
<i>Would Narukami-kun take over
the inn for us, I wonder?</i>

00:07:14.420 --> 00:07:17.010
<i>But first, he'd have to
go through training!</i>

00:07:17.010 --> 00:07:19.840
<i>He is a great cook...
He could totally be an itamae!</i>

00:07:20.840 --> 00:07:23.180
Here it is, Mistress!

00:07:24.220 --> 00:07:25.540
That might actually be up his alley.

00:07:26.520 --> 00:07:29.810
Cute girl? Or should I go for sexy?

00:07:31.100 --> 00:07:33.820
I should've asked
Senpai what he likes!

00:07:35.400 --> 00:07:36.740
But I'm so happy.

00:07:36.740 --> 00:07:39.990
I never thought I'd be spending
Christmas Eve alone with him.

00:07:39.990 --> 00:07:43.070
Oh, but Senpai can be pretty spacey...

00:07:43.070 --> 00:07:45.700
I wonder if he'll lead me on?

00:07:45.950 --> 00:07:50.710
If nothing happened after
a Christmas Eve date, it would be too sad...

00:07:53.040 --> 00:07:55.210
I need a clincher here...

00:07:55.710 --> 00:07:59.220
A present? A surprise? No, no...

00:08:00.130 --> 00:08:01.820
A man's heart is through his stomach!

00:08:02.590 --> 00:08:04.350
Cafe Jun

00:08:06.770 --> 00:08:08.560
<i>Christmas Eve...</i>

00:08:08.560 --> 00:08:11.640
<i>an event for lovers
to spend time together.</i>

00:08:11.640 --> 00:08:13.980
<i>If that's the case, then
just as I thought, Senpai...</i>

00:08:13.980 --> 00:08:15.980
<i>...was asking me out on a date?</i>

00:08:16.230 --> 00:08:19.240
<i>No... stay calm, Naoto Shirogane...</i>

00:08:19.610 --> 00:08:22.110
<i>Senpai and I don't have
that kind of relationship...</i>

00:08:22.110 --> 00:08:25.660
<i>So no way would he ask me
on a date on Christmas Eve!</i>

00:08:25.660 --> 00:08:27.580
<i>He must have some other agenda...</i>

00:08:27.580 --> 00:08:29.200
<i>Some other goal in mind...</i>

00:08:29.200 --> 00:08:30.830
<i>I've got to figure out what it is.</i>

00:08:30.830 --> 00:08:34.580
<i>I'll be fine! I'm a detective. I should
be able to pinpoint it without fail!</i>

00:08:34.580 --> 00:08:35.920
<i>The truth...</i>

00:08:38.340 --> 00:08:40.260
<i>Would this theory hold water?</i>

00:08:40.550 --> 00:08:45.640
<i>Christmas Eve is the most natural day of
the year for a guy to ask a girl out.</i>

00:08:45.640 --> 00:08:47.930
<i>Therefore, using that
naturalness as a camouflage,</i>

00:08:47.930 --> 00:08:51.390
<i>what are the odds that he's
summoning me for another purpose?</i>

00:08:51.690 --> 00:08:56.270
<i>For example, as I'm a detective,
he might want to get me alone so he can...</i>

00:08:56.650 --> 00:08:58.020
<i>...stab me to death!</i>

00:09:04.320 --> 00:09:06.910
<i>What am I thinking?
For heaven's sake!</i>

00:09:06.910 --> 00:09:08.540
Miss, are you all right?

00:09:13.540 --> 00:09:18.040
<i>Since it's Christmas, it's natural
to give him a gift, right?</i>

00:09:19.630 --> 00:09:21.340
Amagi-senpai?

00:09:21.340 --> 00:09:22.670
N-Naoto-kun?

00:09:22.670 --> 00:09:25.010
You just hid something
behind you, didn't you?

00:09:25.010 --> 00:09:26.850
Y-You're just imagining things!

00:09:31.390 --> 00:09:32.180
Is that...

00:09:32.180 --> 00:09:33.560
No, no, it's not!

00:09:33.770 --> 00:09:34.560
But...

00:09:34.560 --> 00:09:37.020
It's nothing! It's nothing, all right?

00:09:37.020 --> 00:09:39.110
See you later, then! Bye!

00:09:41.610 --> 00:09:44.490
<i>I'm sure that was a knife.</i>

00:09:44.490 --> 00:09:45.610
<i>Don't tell me...</i>

00:09:47.120 --> 00:09:48.580
<i>A lethal weapon?</i>

00:09:51.240 --> 00:09:53.620
<i>No question, I'm not
acting normally today.</i>

00:09:54.330 --> 00:09:58.380
<i>Am I really that flustered by
the fact that Senpai asked me out?</i>

00:09:59.460 --> 00:10:00.960
<i>I'm going to calm down.</i>

00:10:00.960 --> 00:10:05.380
<i>If I have a meal and take it easy,
I should go back to normal.</i>

00:10:07.640 --> 00:10:08.640
Please!

00:10:08.930 --> 00:10:11.890
Tell me how to cook a meal
that will tickle a man's soul!

00:10:11.890 --> 00:10:12.640
Can't do it.

00:10:12.640 --> 00:10:14.140
Isn't there any way?

00:10:14.140 --> 00:10:16.600
You're good at making stuff
besides beef bowls, right?

00:10:16.600 --> 00:10:18.480
But I'm delivery-only.

00:10:18.480 --> 00:10:19.650
Please!

00:10:19.940 --> 00:10:22.980
Something that can take them out
for sure in one blow!

00:10:23.740 --> 00:10:25.860
<i>Take them out in one blow?</i>

00:10:31.080 --> 00:10:33.790
<i>Amagi-senpai, hiding a weapon...</i>

00:10:33.790 --> 00:10:37.170
<i>Kujikawa-san, searching for
a way to take someone out.</i>

00:10:37.620 --> 00:10:40.340
<i>There's no question that
those two are co-conspirators.</i>

00:10:40.340 --> 00:10:44.670
<i>With this much circumstantial
evidence... there's no room for doubt.</i>

00:10:45.300 --> 00:10:48.430
<i>I'm going to be killed tomorrow!</i>

00:10:50.390 --> 00:10:55.630
<i>Now that it's come to this, I've got to pinpoint
who are my allies and who are my enemies.</i>

00:10:56.640 --> 00:10:59.770
<i>I'm gonna destroy you
with the children's dreams!</i>

00:11:01.690 --> 00:11:04.230
Ah, this never fails
to calm me down.

00:11:05.740 --> 00:11:08.910
<i>All right, spit it out!
The mastermind's name!</i>

00:11:06.440 --> 00:11:08.070
Naoto-kun?

00:11:08.070 --> 00:11:08.910
Hello?

00:11:09.780 --> 00:11:13.080
Hello? It's about Amagi-senpai...

00:11:10.530 --> 00:11:13.660
<i>Kill me! Just kill me, will you?</i>

00:11:14.540 --> 00:11:15.750
Huh?

00:11:16.290 --> 00:11:18.210
I wonder what she wanted.

00:11:16.450 --> 00:11:18.210
<i>Kill me...</i>

00:11:18.210 --> 00:11:19.400
<i>Come on, kill me!</i>

00:11:19.920 --> 00:11:23.420
<i>That voice just now... It sounded
like Tatsumi-kun to me...</i>

00:11:24.000 --> 00:11:25.840
<i>Don't tell me they're already...</i>

00:11:25.840 --> 00:11:28.430
Kill me! Just kill me, will you?

00:11:28.970 --> 00:11:32.300
<i>What kind of terrifying
day awaits me?</i>

00:11:32.300 --> 00:11:33.680
<i>Tomorrow...</i>

00:11:34.430 --> 00:11:35.680
<i>Tomorrow...</i>

00:11:36.680 --> 00:11:37.680
<i>Tomorrow...</i>

00:11:38.180 --> 00:11:39.520
<i>Tomorrow...</i>

00:11:41.150 --> 00:11:43.690
<i>I hope it turns out to be
a day to remember...</i>

00:11:44.360 --> 00:11:45.610
<i>Tomorrow...</i>

00:11:56.160 --> 00:11:57.120
Can't make it?

00:11:57.250 --> 00:12:00.920
That's right. The kids who were
supposed be on shift suddenly bailed,

00:12:00.920 --> 00:12:03.790
and now Yosuke and I are
picking up the slack.

00:12:03.790 --> 00:12:06.460
I think we should get there
by the time the party starts,

00:12:06.460 --> 00:12:10.220
but it doesn't look like we can
help you get ready. Sorry!

00:12:10.380 --> 00:12:12.010
I see.

00:12:12.010 --> 00:12:14.300
I just got a call from Kanji, too.

00:12:14.300 --> 00:12:16.930
His mom threw her back out and
he has to take her to the hospital,

00:12:16.930 --> 00:12:18.560
so he can't come over to help.

00:12:18.560 --> 00:12:22.100
<i>What? Then you mean you have to
get ready all by yourself?</i>

00:12:22.400 --> 00:12:23.900
Looks like it.

00:12:24.690 --> 00:12:28.150
<i>All right! Let me send you
some replacement helpers!</i>

00:12:28.150 --> 00:12:28.990
Helpers?

00:12:29.190 --> 00:12:32.910
Yeah! I'm gonna see if I can
get anyone to go over and help,

00:12:32.910 --> 00:12:35.660
so you can just leave it
to me and wait, all right?

00:12:35.660 --> 00:12:37.330
<i>All right. I'm counting on you.</i>

00:12:37.330 --> 00:12:39.000
Just leave it to Teddie!

00:12:41.330 --> 00:12:46.500
<i>It's still totally not six o'clock yet,
but I'm so excited, I'm already here!</i>

00:12:46.670 --> 00:12:50.840
<i>Because that way, I can be
with Senpai even longer...</i>

00:12:51.010 --> 00:12:53.890
Oh, no... Did I forget to buy it?

00:12:53.890 --> 00:12:56.760
Do I have time to go
shopping? No, I don't.

00:12:57.260 --> 00:12:58.100
Helper?

00:12:59.140 --> 00:13:00.310
I'm here.

00:13:00.730 --> 00:13:02.190
I-I see...

00:13:02.560 --> 00:13:05.690
<i>What's Teddie thinking,
asking Rise to help out?</i>

00:13:05.690 --> 00:13:07.770
<i>We can't let her go into the kitchen.</i>

00:13:07.770 --> 00:13:09.690
I can come in, right?

00:13:10.610 --> 00:13:12.950
Show me your room.

00:13:13.280 --> 00:13:14.610
Huh? Wait...

00:13:18.200 --> 00:13:20.500
So this is your room, Senpai...

00:13:20.500 --> 00:13:21.830
Well, yes, it is.

00:13:22.120 --> 00:13:23.870
You know what, Senpai?

00:13:23.870 --> 00:13:27.290
I thought it over really hard today.

00:13:27.290 --> 00:13:30.960
What I could do that would
make you happy...

00:13:30.960 --> 00:13:35.180
I came up with a lot of things -
presents or cooking for you.

00:13:35.180 --> 00:13:37.890
But it didn't seem like
the right thing to do...

00:13:38.220 --> 00:13:39.810
So I...

00:13:39.810 --> 00:13:43.060
I've decided to give you
everything that you want, Senpai.

00:13:43.060 --> 00:13:46.150
<i>I see. So I should ask her
to go shopping, huh?</i>

00:13:46.150 --> 00:13:50.360
Tell me, Senpai. What do you
want me to do more than anything?

00:13:50.900 --> 00:13:53.650
First, could you go buy me
an Aramaki salmon?

00:13:54.450 --> 00:13:56.070
<i>Aramaki salmon, huh?</i>

00:13:56.070 --> 00:13:58.580
<i>Aramaki salmon... Aramaki salmon...</i>

00:13:58.580 --> 00:14:00.790
<i>I wonder if they'll have it at Junes?</i>

00:14:02.000 --> 00:14:05.290
<i>I've got to come right out and
ask him before six o' clock...</i>

00:14:05.290 --> 00:14:08.000
<i>Narukami-kun's true feelings...</i>

00:14:08.000 --> 00:14:11.250
<i>I can't wait till night in this edgy state!</i>

00:14:11.800 --> 00:14:14.260
Now, then... Time for
the harvest...

00:14:17.300 --> 00:14:18.600
Hello? Dojima residence.

00:14:18.600 --> 00:14:19.510
<i>Is that you, Yu?</i>

00:14:19.510 --> 00:14:20.260
Uncle?

00:14:20.260 --> 00:14:22.520
<i>Good, you're at home.</i>

00:14:22.520 --> 00:14:26.060
<i>The thing is, they're letting
Nanako come home temporarily.</i>

00:14:26.060 --> 00:14:27.270
Really?

00:14:27.270 --> 00:14:31.230
<i>That's right. Starting tomorrow,
she'll be able to spend time at home.</i>

00:14:31.230 --> 00:14:32.400
That's great!

00:14:32.400 --> 00:14:37.280
<i>And so, sorry to bother you, but could you bring
a change of clothes for Nanako to the hospital?</i>

00:14:37.280 --> 00:14:39.820
<i>We'd like them
right away, if possible.</i>

00:14:39.820 --> 00:14:41.700
Right away, did you say?

00:14:43.080 --> 00:14:48.120
Listen, Narukami-kun... You see,
I want to ask you how you feel about...

00:14:48.120 --> 00:14:49.540
Perfect timing!

00:14:52.590 --> 00:14:53.550
Why?

00:14:53.880 --> 00:14:55.170
Sorry! I owe you one!

00:14:55.170 --> 00:14:57.050
S-Sure...

00:15:01.640 --> 00:15:04.310
<i>I couldn't sleep a wink last night.</i>

00:15:04.310 --> 00:15:07.140
<i>I can't wait until tonight
with this kind of feeling.</i>

00:15:07.140 --> 00:15:10.560
<i>I've got to find out how
Narukami-kun really feels...</i>

00:15:12.610 --> 00:15:14.570
Hey, so these are homegrown!

00:15:15.190 --> 00:15:17.740
I can sense a master's touch here.

00:15:18.860 --> 00:15:20.120
Uh-oh!

00:15:20.120 --> 00:15:21.870
Forgot to turn off the stove...

00:15:24.330 --> 00:15:25.330
Amagi!

00:15:25.330 --> 00:15:27.080
Um... Narukami-kun...

00:15:27.370 --> 00:15:28.870
Thanks, you saved my life!

00:15:28.870 --> 00:15:31.080
Could you keep an eye on the pot?

00:15:31.080 --> 00:15:33.960
All you have to do is
keep an eye on it! Thanks!

00:15:35.800 --> 00:15:38.590
<i>I wonder how many helpers
Teddie's sending over?</i>

00:15:44.720 --> 00:15:47.270
By pot, does he mean that one?

00:15:59.400 --> 00:16:03.990
Jeez... why should I have to help out
at someone's house on Christmas Eve?

00:16:04.580 --> 00:16:11.080
Please! I want you, Ichijo-kun,
and Nagase-kun to help Sensei out.

00:16:13.340 --> 00:16:15.840
Wow! That's totally amazing!

00:16:16.630 --> 00:16:19.590
W-Well, I guess if it's
just this one time...

00:16:26.770 --> 00:16:28.850
Why aren't you answering the door?

00:16:33.610 --> 00:16:35.690
I wonder if this will do?

00:16:42.360 --> 00:16:43.280
Wh-What?

00:16:43.280 --> 00:16:44.910
Stay away!

00:16:51.540 --> 00:16:54.290
Chie Satonaka...

00:16:54.540 --> 00:16:57.550
M-Ms. Ebihara?

00:17:04.470 --> 00:17:06.930
<i>For Senpai to ask me
on Christmas Eve...</i>

00:17:06.930 --> 00:17:12.020
<i>Th-That night...
to ask me out on a date...</i>

00:17:12.020 --> 00:17:13.400
<i>Impossible!</i>

00:17:13.400 --> 00:17:16.310
<i>That's right, this is an incident!</i>

00:17:16.480 --> 00:17:19.150
<i>No matter what kind of
danger lies in wait,</i>

00:17:19.150 --> 00:17:21.820
<i>I've got to find out the truth.</i>

00:17:24.700 --> 00:17:26.990
Senpai! I bought it!

00:17:26.990 --> 00:17:29.450
You're always, always
doing this to me...

00:17:29.450 --> 00:17:32.080
Hold up! No throwing!

00:17:32.370 --> 00:17:33.620
Chie?

00:17:33.620 --> 00:17:34.920
Why are you...?

00:18:07.240 --> 00:18:08.200
<i>It's open!</i>

00:18:25.470 --> 00:18:29.140
Wh-What's this catastrophe?

00:18:31.560 --> 00:18:33.140
What's this doing here?

00:18:34.180 --> 00:18:35.390
Huh? Naoto?

00:18:35.640 --> 00:18:39.230
S-Senpai! W-With that knife...

00:19:02.670 --> 00:19:04.760
Merry Christmas!

00:19:05.510 --> 00:19:07.260
Amazing!

00:19:07.680 --> 00:19:11.180
Well, we're celebrating your temporary
discharge, Nanako, and Christmas!

00:19:11.180 --> 00:19:15.890
Sorry about this. You were supposed to
have your Christmas party yesterday, right?

00:19:15.890 --> 00:19:19.980
Oh, no, a lot of things happened yesterday,
so we were going to postpone it anyway.

00:19:19.980 --> 00:19:22.110
Right, a lot of things happened...

00:19:24.530 --> 00:19:26.190
A lot of things, you see!

00:19:26.190 --> 00:19:27.650
Yes, a lot of things.

00:19:31.990 --> 00:19:33.830
What's wrong, Big Bro?

00:19:33.830 --> 00:19:35.660
Don't worry about it, Nanako.

00:19:35.870 --> 00:19:39.170
Listen, I've got a present
for you, Nana-chan!

00:19:40.130 --> 00:19:41.170
Ta-da!

00:19:42.290 --> 00:19:43.960
It looks exactly like you, Teddie-san!

00:19:43.960 --> 00:19:45.880
By the way, that's bear fur.

00:19:45.880 --> 00:19:48.170
Because I like to keep it real.

00:19:48.170 --> 00:19:49.090
Thank you!

00:19:49.590 --> 00:19:51.390
Good for you, Nanako.

00:19:51.390 --> 00:19:52.640
Yes!

00:19:54.810 --> 00:19:57.560
Well, all's well that ends
well, I guess. Right?

00:19:57.560 --> 00:20:00.100
Yeah. We've made a great memory.

00:20:05.030 --> 00:20:05.780
Five!

00:20:06.030 --> 00:20:06.780
Four!

00:20:06.990 --> 00:20:07.780
Three!

00:20:08.030 --> 00:20:08.780
Two!

00:20:09.110 --> 00:20:10.780
One!

00:20:11.110 --> 00:20:13.280
Happy New Year!

00:20:16.620 --> 00:20:18.500
It's snowing!

00:20:31.970 --> 00:20:34.100
Big Bro, that's awesome!

00:20:34.350 --> 00:20:35.430
Done!

00:20:35.430 --> 00:20:38.100
This Teddie-san snowman is so cool!

00:20:39.980 --> 00:20:41.690
We made a nice memory, huh?

00:20:41.690 --> 00:20:44.730
Yes! Let's make another one
sometime - a snowman.

00:20:44.730 --> 00:20:46.070
Sure.

00:20:54.950 --> 00:20:57.370
He's totally got a cold.

00:20:57.370 --> 00:20:58.500
He's really suffering.

00:20:58.660 --> 00:20:59.830
What should we do?

00:20:59.830 --> 00:21:03.420
Both Dojima-san and Nanako-chan
went back to the hospital...

00:21:03.420 --> 00:21:06.000
No need to worry!

00:21:06.290 --> 00:21:09.130
I'll spend the night
and look after Sensei!

00:21:09.380 --> 00:21:10.840
Hey! No fair!

00:21:10.840 --> 00:21:12.800
I mean, is he gonna cut it?

00:21:13.010 --> 00:21:16.510
Well, first why don't we
move him to his bed?

00:21:16.510 --> 00:21:18.560
I don't think he should
be under the kotatsu...

00:21:18.560 --> 00:21:21.350
Isn't the kotatsu the place
to be when you're chilly?

00:21:21.350 --> 00:21:24.020
I guess we'll have to
postpone our ski trip.

00:21:24.020 --> 00:21:28.150
Yes... It's Narukami-kun's
trip for making memories.

00:21:28.650 --> 00:21:31.570
There'd be no point
if he weren't there...

00:21:31.570 --> 00:21:33.910
Making... memories?

00:21:33.910 --> 00:21:35.700
Hey, don't push yourself too hard.

00:21:35.700 --> 00:21:37.870
We've still got time.

00:21:46.380 --> 00:21:49.960
You were trying to keep
that promise, weren't you?

00:21:49.960 --> 00:21:51.510
Thanks.

00:21:51.510 --> 00:21:52.840
Who's that?

00:21:53.170 --> 00:21:55.510
But it's all right now.

00:21:55.510 --> 00:21:57.470
Because there's no need...

00:21:57.470 --> 00:21:58.850
Who are you?

00:21:59.180 --> 00:22:01.680
This is really the last time.

00:22:01.680 --> 00:22:03.690
I came to tell you goodbye.

00:22:04.230 --> 00:22:06.900
I really enjoyed... being with you.

00:22:06.900 --> 00:22:08.360
Goodbye?

00:22:08.690 --> 00:22:09.860
Thank you...

00:22:10.150 --> 00:22:13.320
I won't forget... Not now...

00:22:13.320 --> 00:22:16.030
And from now on... Always...

00:22:16.030 --> 00:22:17.620
Always...

00:22:17.620 --> 00:22:19.240
Wait.

00:22:29.340 --> 00:22:31.050
Why?

00:24:03.470 --> 00:24:04.600
Ghost photos?

00:24:04.600 --> 00:24:06.640
I thought we were just
taking them normally...

00:24:06.640 --> 00:24:08.180
No... It wasn't me...

00:24:08.180 --> 00:24:09.940
All right! Let's go!

00:24:09.940 --> 00:24:11.730
Yay!

00:24:11.730 --> 00:24:13.480
Will you catch me?
